daemons: longs running system service( process) in bg
systemctl and journalctl manage and monitor the entire operating system and primarily used to control daemons. 

1) Check status: sudo systemctl status mediamtx
2) View logs: sudo journalctl -u mediamtx -f
3) Stop service: sudo systemctl stop mediamtx
4) Restart service: sudo systemctl restart mediamtx

-> nohup ./mediamtx > mediamtx.log 2>&1 &  // ./m > m.log means redirect '1'(stout) to -> keep it running in bg 

